  "body": "## Before/after screenshots\n\nReal 1280×720 egui shell renders with offline `ScriptedTransport`. Images live only on the fork's `pr-screenshots` branch at `775c2b7ce0ff9d017a6161fd6784fe901bfae2a1`.\n\n| Behavior | Before | After |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| One Ctrl+Z after a three-command AI turn | ![Stock and tool remain after undo](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/775c2b7ce0ff9d017a6161fd6784fe901bfae2a1/2260/before-one-ctrl-z.png) | ![All three turn edits removed after undo](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/775c2b7ce0ff9d017a6161fd6784fe901bfae2a1/2260/after-one-ctrl-z.png) |\n| Native-mode machine edit | ![Machine loads without confirmation](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/775c2b7ce0ff9d017a6161fd6784fe901bfae2a1/2260/before-machine-confirmation.png) | ![Machine edit waits for Allow or Deny](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/775c2b7ce0ff9d017a6161fd6784fe901bfae2a1/2260/after-machine-confirmation.png) |\n\nThe before renders reproduce the prior behavior with temporary reversions: disable history-group folding for undo; restore the former Native confirmation allowlist and bypass the newly added live gate for `load_machine` for machine loading. The after renders use the current PR behavior. All capture edits were restored; no screenshots or capture code were added to this PR branch.\n\nExisting pins were mutation-checked again: `one_ctrl_z_reverts_multi_call_ai_chat_turn` and `machine_and_limit_edits_require_confirmation_and_unapproved_live_dispatch_blocks` both failed with their behavior reverted and passed after restoration.\n\n## What changed\n- Added `BatchCommand` and stackable `History::begin_group` / `commit_group` / `cancel_group` in `crates/app/src/commands/batch.rs` and `crates/app/src/commands/mod.rs`.\n- Wired `State::submit_ai_prompt`, `State::run`, `AiChatState::poll`, and `ChatTurn::finish` so a contiguous multi-call AI turn commits as one `BatchCommand` undo step (`Ctrl+Z` / `Ctrl+Y`).\n- Added the read-only `get_selection` MCP tool (`crates/app/src/mcp/selection.rs`) and `SelectionContext` snapshot (`State::selection_context`) so live sessions report selected entities, active setup, selected/active operation, viewport `pick_mode`, and `geometry_picks` without breaking `ui -> app` layering.\n- Added `LiveGate`, `GateKind`, `ApprovedCall`, `requires_approval`, `LiveOptions`, and `answer_live_with` in `crates/app/src/mcp/live.rs`; `answer_live` now fails closed via `&LiveOptions::default()`.\n- Updated `AiChatState`, `transport::requires_confirmation`, `worker`, and `mcp_host::pump` to share `requires_approval` and `is_read_only_tool`, bind `Allow` clicks to one `ApprovedCall`, and never auto-approve `post`, `load_machine`, or `edit_machine`.\n- Updated `undo_turn_reverts_multi_tool_turn_changes_in_one_click_and_guards_later_edits` (`#2094`) from `pre_depth + 3` to `pre_depth + 1` to reflect the collapsed `BatchCommand` entry.\n- Recorded design decisions in `docs/decisions/1942-ai-chat-safety.md`.\n\n## Cause\nBefore this fix, AI chat turns pushed one `History` entry per tool call (requiring multiple `Ctrl+Z` presses), `get_selection` did not exist for AI inspection of viewport picks, `FallbackMode::Native` skipped confirmation for machine and limit tools, and `answer_live` lacked a server-side permission gate.\n\n## Tests\nPinning tests (all red on unchanged `upstream/main` `e808c9629`, green after fix):\n- `camcraft-app --test batch_undo`: `begin_and_commit_group_folds_multi_command_turn_into_one_undo_step`, `empty_and_nested_groups_and_direct_batch_command_behave_cleanly`, `cancel_group_keeps_existing_commands_separate` (3 passed, 0 failed).\n- `camcraft-app --test mcp_live`: `get_selection_returns_selected_entities_and_empty_picks_headless`, `live_permission_gate_blocks_unapproved_post_file_writes_paths_and_machine_limits`, `get_selection_reads_live_ui_selection_context_and_prompt_json_treats_it_read_only`, `live_gate_allows_explicitly_approved_calls_and_never_auto_approves_post_or_machine_edits` (14 passed, 0 failed in `mcp_live`; `mcp`: 22 passed; `mcp_provider`: 9 passed).\n- `camcraft-ui --lib`: `one_ctrl_z_reverts_multi_call_ai_chat_turn`, `get_selection_mcp_tool_reads_ui_geo_picks_pick_mode_and_selected_entities`, `machine_and_limit_edits_require_confirmation_and_unapproved_live_dispatch_blocks`, plus updated #2094 `undo_turn_reverts_multi_tool_turn_changes_in_one_click_and_guards_later_edits` (`camcraft-ui --lib`: 968 passed, 0 failed, 6 ignored).\n\nMutation checks (all 5 confirmed red when reverted, green when restored):\n1. Bypass `LiveGate::check` (`Ok(())`): `live_permission_gate_blocks_unapproved_post_file_writes_paths_and_machine_limits` failed (wrote `blocked.nc`), restored -> passed.\n2. Bypass `GateKind::allows_auto_approve` (`true`): `live_gate_allows_explicitly_approved_calls_and_never_auto_approves_post_or_machine_edits` failed (`post` auto-approved), restored -> passed.\n3. Revert `transport::requires_confirmation` `Native` arm to the old 6-tool list: `machine_and_limit_edits_require_confirmation_and_unapproved_live_dispatch_blocks` failed (timed out waiting for confirmation), restored -> passed.\n4. Make `History::commit_group` return `false` without batching: `begin_and_commit_group_folds_multi_command_turn_into_one_undo_step` and `one_ctrl_z_reverts_multi_call_ai_chat_turn` failed, restored -> passed.\n5. Pass `selection: None` in `mcp_host::answer_request`: `get_selection_mcp_tool_reads_ui_geo_picks_pick_mode_and_selected_entities` failed (`pick_mode` null), restored -> passed.\n\nGate and clippy:\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: 271 of 273 steps passed (`app:lib` 355 passed / 1 ignored, 254 `app` suites, `ui:lib` 968 passed / 6 ignored, 14 `ui` suites); only `app build (--no-run)` and `app suites: wire_tool` failed to compile due to pre-existing `upstream/main` issue `#2244` (`crates/app/tests/wire_tool.rs:106` `CuttingRow` literal mismatch).\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings` hit the same `#2244` compile error in `wire_tool.rs`; targeting `camcraft-app` (`--lib --bins --test batch_undo --test mcp_live --test mcp --test mcp_provider`) and `camcraft-ui --all-targets` passed with `-D warnings`.\n\n## Goldens moved\nNone (`git diff --stat upstream/main -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` is empty).\n\n## Not exercised\n- Interactive live HTTPS calls to an external LLM API endpoint (tested via `ScriptedTransport` and live JSON-RPC loopback `Request::pair` dispatch).\n- Pre-existing broken binary `crates/app/tests/wire_tool.rs` (`#2244` on `upstream/main`).\n- Full `gate batch` and `gate release` suites (only `gate quick` ran per issue-worker rules).\n\n## Overlaps\nTouches the same files (different functions/items; whichever merges second refreshes): `#2259`, `#2256`, `#2254`, `#2253`, `#2197`, `#2187`, `#2185`, `#2150`, `#2149`, `#2134`, `#2122` (`needs-maintainer`), `#2100`, `#2092`, `#2077`, `#1798`, `#1738`, `#1330`.\n\nBranched from `upstream/main` (`e808c9629`).\nEffort: high\nChangelog: AI chat turns now undo in one grouped Ctrl+Z step, expose read-only `get_selection`, and enforce live confirmation gating.\nFixes #1942\n",
